1
00:00:00,881 --> 00:00:02,993
As Uke comes forward to grab your shoulder

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:04,266
draw him back

3
00:00:04,567 --> 00:00:08,421
placing the opposite hand in his face 
to control the space and the distance

4
00:00:08,422 --> 00:00:10,112
Cut down to his wrist

5
00:00:10,413 --> 00:00:13,430
controlling his elbow take a deep step to his rear

6
00:00:13,431 --> 00:00:15,395
turning his body around in front of you,

7
00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:19,544
as you do so, switch the grip 
and control his wrist with the opposite hand, 

8
00:00:19,545 --> 00:00:23,072
continuing to stay behind Uke´s body 
draw him round behind

9
00:00:23,373 --> 00:00:25,576
placing him down in front of your knees

10
00:00:25,577 --> 00:00:26,944
control his shoulder

11
00:00:26,945 --> 00:00:29,466
switch the hands back to control his wrist

12
00:00:29,467 --> 00:00:30,555
place it against your shoulder,

13
00:00:30,556 --> 00:00:32,738
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

